ot get us to Maduro as a  savior and the opposition are terrorists  installed by the American CIA we've seen  allegations that the opposition in  Venezuela is ringers or that the  opposition is faking  the bad act by the government to make  them look bad right a sort of false flag  or something all of those arguments  could have anecdotal grains of truth but  the narrative constructed from it is  completely bogus and another one is it's  astroturf the protest the opposition  protests are astroturf paid for by the  United States there is really good  reporting from other countries about  what's going on in Venezuela and I would  implore you a lot of these are subtitled  when you look at them on YouTube for  people who don't understand Spanish  check out what's happening on the ground  there and and find out for yourself you  know whether or not you can point to one  protest in Venezuela that was u.s.  sponsored whatever that means and it's  very hard to prove a negative as we know  there are endless protests and  opposition activism in Venezuela that  have no connection whatsoever to  American money so I'm really concerned  about what's going on there from a  humanitarian perspective but I'm also  really concerned about this string on  the American left and this is the same  people that are denying any Trump Russia  collusion despite the fact that we now  have Trump lying about Trump jr.  statement and drafting it and in-person  intent to collude via a meeting with a  Russian lawyer I mean it's endless right  the same contingent that is pretending  that there's nothing to see there is  often the same contingent that is  defending Venezuela as some amazing  example of democratic socialism and the  truth is that it is far from it it is a  right-wing authoritarian regime send me  your thoughts I know many of you will  disagree many will say David's a shill  for who I don't know because I don't  even know what it is that the CIA has  said about this I frankly don't care 